Title: Shri Manohar Untwal an elected Member from Dewas Parliamentary Constituency of Madhya Pradesh; Shri Nagendra Singh, an elected Member from Khajuraho Parliamentary Constituency of Madhya Pradesh; Dr. Raghu Sharma, an elected Member from Ajmer Parliamentary Constituency of Rajasthan; Shri Tamradhwaj Sahu, an elected Member from Durg Parliamentary Constituency of Chattisgarh and Shri Harish Chandra Meena, an elected Member from Dausa Parliamentary Constituency of Rajasthan, resigned from their membership of 16th Lok Sabha. 

माननीय अध्यक्ष: माननीय सदस्यगण, मुझे सदन को लोक सभा के निम्नलिखित पांच सदस्यों द्वारा त्यागपत्र दिए जाने के बारे में सूचित करना है:-

1. श्री मनोहर उटवाल (देवास, मध्य प्रदेश);

2. श्री नागेन्द्र सिंह (खजुराहो, मध्य प्रदेश);

3. डॉ. रघु शर्मा (अजमेर, राजस्थान);

4. श्री ताम्रध्वज साहू (दुर्ग, छत्तीसगढ़);

5. श्री हरीश मीना (दौसा, राजस्थान)

मैंने इनके त्यागपत्र स्वीकार कर लिये हैं।

…(व्यवधान)

